     "ghost": "{ch2} left you on read after that session, so this one came through {first} instead. The shoot is tight, and a grip asks, a bit too casually, whether you and {ch2} still talk.",
     "grudge": "{ch2} is telling anyone who’ll listen that you stole the credit. {first} booked you anyway, and the crew watches you like they’ve all read the same group chat."
